@startuml
title XP increment with test-driven development and evidence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
|Planning Game|
start
:Select ready story and priority;
:Confirm UR / FR / NFR links;
:Write examples and acceptance tests;
|Developer + reviewer|
:Model risky behavior with UML;
:Write smallest failing test (RED);
if (Fails for expected reason?) then (yes)
  :Implement minimum behavior (GREEN);
else (no)
  :Correct test or requirement;
  -left-> Write smallest failing test (RED);
endif
if (Focused tests pass?) then (yes)
  :Refactor design and code;
else (no)
  -left-> Implement minimum behavior (GREEN);
endif
:Run unit, contract, integration,\nstatic and regression checks;
if (Quality gates pass?) then (yes)
  |User / reviewer|
  :Demonstrate story confirmation;
else (no)
  |Developer + reviewer|
  :Diagnose failure and add test;
  -left-> Implement minimum behavior (GREEN);
endif
if (Acceptance passes?) then (yes)
  :Accept story and record evidence;
  |Planning Game|
  :Review and retrospective;
  :Update backlog and next story;
  stop
else (no)
  :Return story with feedback;
  -left-> Write examples and acceptance tests;
endif
@enduml
